{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"about-page\">\n\n  <div class=\"about-banner\">\n    <div class=\"cloud cloud-one\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cloud cloud-two\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <div class=\"welcome-text\">A LITTLE MORE ABOUT ME</div>\n      <h1>Hello, nice to meet you! ♡</h1>\n      <p class=\"tagline\">\n        Mathematics, data science &amp; lifelong curiosity.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cloud-border\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"story-section\">\n\n    <img class=\"about-photo\"\n         src=\"headshot.jpeg\"\n         alt=\"Maxine Hakimi-Bulson\">\n\n    <div class=\"story-text\">\n      <h2>My Story</h2>\n\n      <p>\n        I'm Maxine, a graduate student pursuing my M.S.\n        in Data Science at Emory University's Laney\n        Graduate School. I previously earned my B.S.\n        in Applied Mathematics and Statistics from\n        Emory University, graduating cum laude.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        My interests lie at the intersection of mathematics,\n        statistics, technology, and real-world problem-solving.\n        I enjoy transforming complex data into meaningful\n        insights and developing solutions that make information\n        more accessible, understandable, and actionable.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        As an actuarial candidate with Exams P and FM\n        passed, I am particularly interested in quantitative\n        modeling, risk analysis, and the application of\n        data science to business decisions.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section-heading\">My Academic Journey</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"academic-timeline\">\n\n    <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-date\">2022 – 2025</div>\n      <h3>B.S. in Applied Mathematics &amp; Statistics</h3>\n      <p>Emory University</p>\n      <p>3.95 GPA · Cum Laude</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-date\">March 2026</div>\n      <h3>Actuarial Exam P</h3>\n      <p>Probability — Passed</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-date\">August 2026</div>\n      <h3>Actuarial Exam FM</h3>\n      <p>Financial Mathematics — Passed</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-date\">2026 – 2027</div>\n      <h3>M.S. in Data Science</h3>\n      <p>Emory University · Laney Graduate School</p>\n      <p>Expected graduation: August 2027</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section-heading\">What I Do</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"info-grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"info-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">💻</div>\n      <h3>Data Science &amp; Research</h3>\n      <p>\n        As a Graduate Data Science Fellow at Emory\n        University's Center for AI Learning, I support\n        Emory Healthcare's Academic Partnerships team\n        through data analysis, visualization, and\n        workflow automation projects.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"info-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">📊</div>\n      <h3>Actuarial Science</h3>\n      <p>\n        I am pursuing a career in actuarial science,\n        combining my mathematical background with\n        statistical modeling, programming, and an\n        interest in understanding risk and uncertainty.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"info-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">🎓</div>\n      <h3>Teaching</h3>\n      <p>\n        As a Regression Analysis Teaching Assistant\n        at Emory University, I help students develop\n        their understanding of statistical methods,\n        regression modeling, and programming in R.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"info-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-icon\">📚</div>\n      <h3>Math2TheMax Tutoring</h3>\n      <p>\n        Through my independent mathematics tutoring\n        business, I provide personalized instruction\n        to help students build mathematical confidence,\n        strengthen problem-solving skills, and achieve\n        their academic goals.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section-heading\">My Technical Toolkit</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"skill-tags\">\n    <span>R</span>\n    <span>Python</span>\n    <span>SQL</span>\n    <span>Java</span>\n    <span>Excel</span>\n    <span>GitHub</span>\n    <span>Quarto</span>\n    <span>SharePoint</span>\n    <span>Power Automate</span>\n    <span>Statistical Modeling</span>\n    <span>Machine Learning</span>\n    <span>Data Visualization</span>\n    <span>Web Scraping</span>\n    <span>Natural Language Processing</span>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<div class=\"personal-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"card-icon\">🧶</div>\n\n  <h2>Beyond the Numbers ♡</h2>\n\n  <p>\n    Outside of academics and work, I love crocheting\n    and bringing creative ideas to life, one stitch\n    at a time. It's a wonderful way to express my\n    creativity and explore something beyond the\n    world of mathematics and data science.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"crochet-gallery\">\n\n    <img src=\"togepi.jpeg\" alt=\"Crocheted togepi\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n    <img src=\"bunny.jpeg\" alt=\"Crocheted bunny\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n    <img src=\"heart.jpeg\" alt=\"Crocheted heart\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n  </div>\n\n  <a class=\"social-button crochet-button\"\n     href=\"https://www.instagram.com/craftedbymaxine/\"\n     target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <i class=\"bi bi-instagram\"></i>\n    @craftedbymaxine\n  </a>\n\n  <p class=\"crochet-caption\">\n    A little creativity, one stitch at a time. ♡\n  </p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n  <p class=\"closing-message\">\n    Always learning, always curious. ♡\n  </p>\n\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"about-page\">\n\n  <div class=\"about-banner\">\n    <div class=\"cloud cloud-one\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cloud cloud-two\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">